QUERY NAME: qryCSG7_OHR
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT tblStaffRequ.Project, tblStaffRequ.Year AS YearNo, Sum(([NoHours]*[tblstaffRequ].[chargerate])*([OHR]+[NPR])/[chargerate]) AS cost, "Overheads" AS Category
FROM tblStaffRequ
GROUP BY tblStaffRequ.Project, tblStaffRequ.Year
HAVING (((tblStaffRequ.Project)=[Forms]![frmProject1]![Project]));

